class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"136d21829e234687\" href=\"?note=136d21829e234687\" title=\"14-thm-etale-bundle-recovery\">14-thm-etale-bundle-recovery</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"f9af6d7fc5c4f8a0\" href=\"?note=f9af6d7fc5c4f8a0\" title=\"14-df-topological-sheaf\">14-df-topological-sheaf</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"46dda10bcd4e0ee1\" href=\"?note=46dda10bcd4e0ee1\" title=\"14-df-germs-and-stalks\">14-df-germs-and-stalks</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"35aa7f1836ebd037\" href=\"?note=35aa7f1836ebd037\" title=\"14-df-stalk-maps\">14-df-stalk-maps</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_location","html":"II.9 Lemma 1 and equations (1)–(4), printed 99–101; DjVu 55–56"},{"key":"source_evidence","html":"附件中的原稿来源记录；本次修订不构成对相应原书或 OCR 的读取证明。"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p>固定 Grothendieck 宇宙 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal U\\in\\mathcal V\">\\(\\mathcal U\\in\\mathcal V\\)</span>；空间载体、截面值与指标集均取于 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal U\">\\(\\mathcal U\\)</span>，有关范畴和函子集合在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal V\">\\(\\mathcal V\\)</span> 中处理。</p>\n<p>设 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f:(X,\\tau)\\to(Y,\\nu)\">\\(f:(X,\\tau)\\to(Y,\\nu)\\)</span> 连续；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G\">\\(G\\)</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Y\">\\(Y\\)</span> 上的层，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Lambda_YG=(E_G,\\sigma_G,p_G)\">\\(\\Lambda_YG=(E_G,\\sigma_G,p_G)\\)</span>。另设 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"H\">\\(H\\)</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Y\">\\(Y\\)</span> 上的层、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"h:G\\to H\">\\(h:G\\to H\\)</span> 自然，其茎映射 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"h_y:G_y\\to H_y\">\\(h_y:G_y\\to H_y\\)</span> 使用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"35aa7f1836ebd037\" href=\"?note=35aa7f1836ebd037\" title=\"14-df-stalk-maps\">14-df-stalk-maps</a>。乘积拓扑 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\tau\\otimes\\sigma_G\">\\(\\tau\\otimes\\sigma_G\\)</span> 与子空间拓扑均采用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"afeb22707a474889\" href=\"?note=afeb22707a474889\" title=\"14-df-etale-maps-and-local-sections\">14-df-etale-maps-and-local-sections</a> 的正式构造。分量公式的参数为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"U\\in\\tau\">\\(U\\in\\tau\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"t\\in\\mathrm{Sec}(q_{f,G},U)\">\\(t\\in\\mathrm{Sec}(q_{f,G},U)\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f^*h\">\\(f^*h\\)</span> 的分量是从 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(f^*G)(U)\">\\((f^*G)(U)\\)</span> 到 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(f^*H)(U)\">\\((f^*H)(U)\\)</span> 的带源靶集合箭头。</p>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Etale}\">\\(\\mathrm{Etale}\\)</span> 沿用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"afeb22707a474889\" href=\"?note=afeb22707a474889\" title=\"14-df-etale-maps-and-local-sections\">14-df-etale-maps-and-local-sections</a> 中的精确签名。 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{IsSheaf}\">\\(\\mathrm{IsSheaf}\\)</span> 沿用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-11\" data-note=\"f9af6d7fc5c4f8a0\" href=\"?note=f9af6d7fc5c4f8a0\" title=\"14-df-topological-sheaf\">14-df-topological-sheaf</a> 中的精确签名。 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Sec}\">\\(\\mathrm{Sec}\\)</span> 沿用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-12\" data-note=\"afeb22707a474889\" href=\"?note=afeb22707a474889\" title=\"14-df-etale-maps-and-local-sections\">14-df-etale-maps-and-local-sections</a> 中的精确签名。 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{germ}\">\\(\\mathrm{germ}\\)</span> 沿用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-13\" data-note=\"46dda10bcd4e0ee1\" href=\"?note=46dda10bcd4e0ee1\" title=\"14-df-germs-and-stalks\">14-df-germs-and-stalks</a> 中的精确签名。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"E_{f,G}=\\{(x,e)\\in X\\times E_G:f(x)=p_G(e)\\},\\quad\\sigma_{f,G}=(\\tau\\otimes\\sigma_G)|_{E_{f,G}},\\quad q_{f,G}(x,e)=x.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[E_{f,G}=\\{(x,e)\\in X\\times E_G:f(x)=p_G(e)\\},\\quad\\sigma_{f,G}=(\\tau\\otimes\\sigma_G)|_{E_{f,G}},\\quad q_{f,G}(x,e)=x.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"f^*G=\\Gamma_X(q_{f,G}),\\qquad(f^*G)(U)=\\mathrm{Sec}(q_{f,G},U).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[f^*G=\\Gamma_X(q_{f,G}),\\qquad(f^*G)(U)=\\mathrm{Sec}(q_{f,G},U).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\widetilde h_f:E_{f,G}\\to E_{f,H},\\qquad\\widetilde h_f(x,(f(x),a))=(x,(f(x),h_{f(x)}(a))),\\qquad(f^*h)_U(t)=\\widetilde h_f\\circ t.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\widetilde h_f:E_{f,G}\\to E_{f,H},\\qquad\\widetilde h_f(x,(f(x),a))=(x,(f(x),h_{f(x)}(a))),\\qquad(f^*h)_U(t)=\\widetilde h_f\\circ t.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Etale}(q_{f,G};E_{f,G},\\sigma_{f,G};X,\\tau),\\qquad\\mathrm{IsSheaf}(f^*G,X,\\tau).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{Etale}(q_{f,G};E_{f,G},\\sigma_{f,G};X,\\tau),\\qquad\\mathrm{IsSheaf}(f^*G,X,\\tau).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"t_{V,s}:f^{-1}[V]\\to E_{f,G},\\qquad t_{V,s}(x)=(x,(f(x),\\mathrm{germ}_{f(x),V}s))\\quad(V\\in\\nu,\\;s\\in G(V)).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[t_{V,s}:f^{-1}[V]\\to E_{f,G},\\qquad t_{V,s}(x)=(x,(f(x),\\mathrm{germ}_{f(x),V}s))\\quad(V\\in\\nu,\\;s\\in G(V)).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>étale 图 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"W\\subseteq E_G\">\\(W\\subseteq E_G\\)</span> 拉回为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"E_{f,G}\\cap(X\\times W)\">\\(E_{f,G}\\cap(X\\times W)\\)</span>，投影同胚于 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f^{-1}[p_GW]\">\\(f^{-1}[p_GW]\\)</span>，所以拉回仍局部同胚。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\widetilde h_f\">\\(\\widetilde h_f\\)</span> 是连续茎空间态射 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Lambda_Yh\">\\(\\Lambda_Yh\\)</span> 的拉回，因而连续且在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\">\\(X\\)</span> 上；与截面复合得到 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f^*h\">\\(f^*h\\)</span>，并逐截面保持恒等和复合，补足逆像函子的箭头作用。公式 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"t_{V,s}\">\\(t_{V,s}\\)</span> 是连续截面，所有这些截面像组成开覆盖。逆像层通常不能写成裸公式 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"U\\mapsto G(f[U])\">\\(U\\mapsto G(f[U])\\)</span>，因为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f[U]\">\\(f[U]\\)</span> 未必开；此构造无需额外开放性假设。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"14-df-etale-space-of-germs","status":"resolved","id":"08a9469876bddf9f","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[14-df-etale-space-of-germs]]","embed":false},{"target":"14-thm-sheaf-of-continuous-sections","status":"resolved","id":"83765a3303e549f5","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[14-thm-sheaf-of-continuous-sections]]","embed":false},{"target":"14-df-etale-maps-and-local-sections","status":"resolved","id":"afeb22707a474889","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[14-df-etale-maps-and-local-sections]]","embed":false},{"target":"14-thm-etale-bundle-recovery","status":"resolve