","anchor":"ref-76","locations":["正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"[[14-df-topological-inverse-image]]"},{"id":"c60ad289d123497b","anchor":"ref-66","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[14-df-topological-inverse-image|Definition II.9 Inverse Image via Pullback of Étale Spaces]]"},{"id":"1dc2712cae6cd02a","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"21220e7f79386305","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"设 $f:(X,\\tau)\\to(Y,\\nu)$ 连续，$G\\in\\operatorname{Ob}(\\mathbf{Sh}(Y,\\nu))$、$F\\in\\operatorname{Ob}(\\mathbf{Sh}(X,\\tau))$。$t_{V,s}$、$f^*,f_*$ 见 [[14-df-topological-inverse-image]]、[[14-df-topological-direct-image]]，$\\eta_F$ 见 [[14-thm-sheaf-recovery-from-germ-sections]]。分量公式的参数为 $V\\in\\nu$、$s\\in G(V)$、$U\\in\\tau$、$t\\in(f^*G)(U)$；$\\eta_{F,U}^{-1}$ 是层恢复同构分量的底层逆函数。"}],"outgoing":["08a9469876bddf9f","83765a3303e549f5","afeb22707a474889","136d21829e234687","f9af6d7fc5c4f8a0","46dda10bcd4e0ee1","35aa7f1836ebd037"]}